From: Acme Security Team <security@acmecorp.com>
To: All Staff <all-staff@acmecorp.com>
Subject: Security notice: phishing emails that copy the Finance portal
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 08:30:00 +0000
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"

Hi all,

This morning several employees received emails that look like the Finance
portal. They ask you to "re-confirm" an expense reimbursement and link to a
fake login page.

A customer, Jane Doe (jane.doe1984@gmail.com, +1 415 555 0134), also
forwarded us a copy that reached her personal inbox, so the attackers are
targeting customers too.

What to do:
- Do not click the link and do not reply.
- If you already entered your password, reset it at https://id.acmecorp.com
  and call the IT hotline at ext. 4357, option 2.
- Forward any suspicious email to security@acmecorp.com.

The real Finance portal never asks you to re-confirm a reimbursement by email.

Thanks,
Acme Security Team
